//! Super standard library manifest
//!
//! Lists every stdlib module by import path, with its layer. Vendor SaaS clients
//! live under `pods/` (openai, claude, supabase, …). Raw OS polling is under
//! `std.sys.epoll` / `std.sys.io_uring`; `std.io.poll` is the unified readiness API.
//! Windowing is `std.gui.window`; game UDP netcode is `std.game.netcode`.

/// `STDLIB_VERSION` is `"0.1.0"`.
+STDLIB_VERSION = "0.1.0"

